ng.Let me see if there\'s more context.\n\nFact 13: Red things are furry.So if something is red, it\'s furry.But Gary is red (fact 6), so Gary is furry.\n\nBut the question is about Harry, not Gary.So Harry is smart, kind, quiet, and blue (from fact 9, since he\'s quiet and smart).Let\'s say Harry is smart, which then makes him unkind, loud, and not blue. Therefore, Harry is not red or furry, based on the given facts about him and Gary.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
