ng at the rules:.\n\n- Rule 11: All blue, kind things are rough.Since Harry is blue and kind, he must be rough.Inconsistent statements are Harry is rough and kind, so he must be quiet. But if Harry is rough and kind, then he\'s quiet. So if Harry is quiet, then the statement "Harry is not quiet" would be true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
