nd young, then they are white.\n- Rule 11: If someone is smart, then they are green.\n- Rule 14: If someone is nice, they are quiet.Bob is not necessarily smart, young, or green. Since Fiona is young and smart, Bob could be old and not smart or green. The context doesn\'t provide enough information to determine Bob\'s characteristics or color.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
