we don\'t know if Erin is big.So that doesn\'t help either.\n\nPoint 8 says all big, rough things are white.Again, we don\'t know if Erin is big or white.\n\nPoint 6 says if something is big and furry, then it\'s green.But again, we don\'t know if Erin is big or furry.\n\nPoint 1 says Dave is furry, green, kind, and smart.So Dave is kind.But does that help with Erin?Not directly, unless there\'s a connection between Dave and Erin, which there doesn\'t seem to be.Based on the information provided, we can confidently determine that Erin is unkind.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
