t let me double-check. The rabbit eats the bald eagle, which means the rabbit visits the bald eagle. Then, by statement 13, if something visits the bald eagle, it is nice. So, the rabbit is nice. Then, by statement 12, if something is nice, it is big. Therefore, the rabbit is big.\n\nSo, the statement \"The rabbit is big\" is true.\n</think>\n\nThe rabbit is big because it visits the bald eagle, making it nice, and thus big.\n\nAnswer: A) True",
