omething is blue, then it is red.So if Gary is blue, he must also be red.But does that affect his color?Well, in logic, if something is blue, it\'s also red, but that\'s a bit confusing because usually colors are mutually exclusive.Despite the elaborate reasoning and logical chain presented, it is still uncertain whether Gary is truly blue or any other color, as there may be additional rules or information that could alter this conclusion.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
