ates that red things are big. Since Bob is red (as per **Statement 16**), this aligns with Bob being big, which is consistent with the given information.\n\n4. **Consistency Check:**\n   - All the logical statements point towards Bob being red. There is no information or statement that contradicts this conclusion.\n\n### Conclusion:\nBased on the logical deductions from the given context, the statement \"Bob is red\" is **True**.\n\n**Answer:**  \n\\boxed{A}",
