Harry is kind (point 9).But Fiona\'s kindness isn\'t mentioned.So, we don\'t know if Fiona is kind or not.She could be kind or not.\n\nIf Fiona is kind, then from point 15, she would be white.But if she\'s not kind, then the statement about being kind and smart doesn\'t apply.However, we don\'t have any information about Fiona\'s kindness.Knowing Fiona\'s age is crucial to determine if she\'s cold. If she\'s young, she might be cold, but without more information, we can\'t be certain.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
