r (statement 9), so according to this, the tiger would chase the bald eagle.But the tiger is red (statement 10), and from statement 15, if someone is red, they chase the lion.So the tiger is chasing the bald eagle, which would mean the tiger needs the bald eagle (statement 13).The bald eagle chases the squirrel, not the other way around.. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 36%|###6      | 219/600 [43:41<10:02,  1.58s/it]
