ething is rough and blue, it must also be red.\n   - From point 15, blue things are big. So, if something is blue, it must be big.\n\n### Conclusion:\nHarry is nice and round, but we don't have information about his color or temperature. Without additional details about whether Harry is cold or red, we cannot definitively determine if Harry is blue.\n\n**Answer:**\n\n\\boxed{C}",
