things are furry. So, if something is not blue and not smart, it\'s furry. But if something is not blue and smart, we don\'t know. Point 11: All not smart, not white things are furry. So, if something is not smart and not white, it\'s furry.\n\nBut back to Fiona. She\'s not blue and not white. So, she\'s not white. Therefore, the statement "Fiona is not white" would be true.\n\nWait, but let me make sure. The context says Fiona is not blue and not white. So, she is not white.. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 42%|####1     | 250/600 [49:21<4:00:46, 41.28s/it]
