lue.So if someone is kind, they must be blue.But from statement 18: If someone is kind and blue, then they are big.So combining these, if someone is kind, they are blue and therefore big.So being kind implies being big.\n\nBut Gary is not big (7), so if being kind implies being big, then Gary cannot be kind.Gary is smart.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
