ats the bear then the bear is red.\n19.If something eats the dog and it is not red then the dog does not need the cow.\n\nNow, the question is about whether the bear eats itself.Let\'s see if any of the statements lead to this conclusion.\n\nLooking at statement 11: If the bear is not green then the bear eats the cat.But from statement 1, the bear is blue, which is not green.So according to statement 11, the bear eats the cat.So bear → eats cat.\n\nThe bear eats the bear, which means the statement is false.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
