ar and they are big, then the bear is big.\n18.If someone eats the squirrel and they chase the bear, then the bear chases the bald eagle.\n19.If someone is red and green, then they eat the bear.\n20.If someone likes the bear and they eat the bear, then the bear eats the bald eagle.\nBased on the information provided, the squirrel\'s color is uncertain, and there may be indirect implications that affect its color. The facts do not definitively state that the squirrel is green or any other color, so further investigation is required to determine its actual color.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
