messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C.\n####\n# Context:\nDave is green. Dave is kind. Erin is cold. Erin is furry. Fiona is big. Fiona is furry. Gary is big. All kind people are cold. Green, smart people are rough. If Fiona is cold and Fiona is kind then Fiona is green. If someone is furry then they are smart. All furry, green people are smart. If someone is green and cold then they are big. If someone is furry and rough then they are big. All furry people are smart. Big, cold people are furry.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or unknown? Erin is smart.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Unknown', "<think>\n.\nOkay, so I'm trying to figure out whether Erin is smart based on the given context.Let me go through the information step by step.\n\nFirst, I'll list out all the facts provided:.\n\n1.Dave is green.\n2.Dave is kind.\n3.Erin is cold.\n4.Erin is furry.\n5.Fiona is big.\n6.Fiona is furry.\n7.Gary is big.\n8.All kind people are cold.\n9.Green, smart people are rough.\n10.If Fiona is cold and Fiona is kind, then Fiona is green.\n11.If someone is furry, then they are smart.\n12.All furry, green people are smart.\n13.If someone is green and cold, then they are big.\n14.If someone is furry and rough, then they are big.\n15.All furry people are smart.Small, warm creatures are not furry.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
