hich again we know.\n- Rule 14 says all green things are quiet, so Dave is quiet.\n\nNow, looking at the colors.Dave is blue, and from rule 9, blue things are green.So Dave is green.But the question is about Dave being red.From the given facts, Dave is blue and big.There\'s no information that directly links Dave to being red.However, Anne is red, but that\'s a separate entity.\nBob is not both green and red.Dave is red, not blue.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
