oung.So, the rabbit\'s age is given.But statement 18 says if the rabbit is young and needs the bald eagle, then it doesn\'t see the bear.But the rabbit doesn\'t need the bald eagle, so that condition applies.\n\nSo, the key point is that the bald eagle is not red (statement 4) and from statement 20, not being red means it doesn\'t need the bear.Then, from statement 19, not needing the bear makes it small.Therefore, the bald eagle must be small.\n\nI see many contradictions and missing information here\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 76%|#######6  | 459/600 [1:06:01<02:29,  1.06s/it]
