given information, Charlie is not blue, not red.So, is there any information that would not suggest Charlie is red?Let\'s not check.\n\nPoint 1 says Anne is not red, but that doesn\'t not say anything about Charlie.Points 2,3,4 are not about Bob, who is not big, not green, and not red.Points 6 and 7 are not about Dave, who is not big and not blue.So, the only thing we can not conclude about Charlie is that he\'s not red, not blue\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
