green.Since we\'ve deduced Harry is green, the statement "Harry is not green" would be false.\n\nWait, let me double-check to make sure I didn\'t miss anything.Let\'s go through each relevant statement again.\n\n- Harry is smart and young (4).\n- Young things are furry (5), so Harry is furry.\n- Furry, smart things are nice (13), so Harry is nice.\n- Nice, furry things are green (6), so Harry is green.\n\nNo, that seems inconsistent\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
