swer is A) True.\n\nBut I'm not entirely sure because the context doesn't directly state it, but the rules do imply it. So, I think the answer is A) True.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Anne is young\" is true based on the logical implications of the given information.\n\n**Answer: A) True**",
